  "name": "Issue 730: Runic Tempest resets Fist of the Ancients and allows Runeshroud abilities while moving",
  "contract": [
    "Runic Tempest 560036 (3 min cooldown, 8 sec aura) reads 'Harness the power of your runic tattoos, resetting the",
    "cooldown of Fist of the Ancients, allowing the use of abilities that require Runeshroud, and allowing you to cast",
    "them while moving for $d.' Effect 2 (195) resets Fist of the Ancients 712326 and its category; effect 0 is aura",
    "313, which Unit::CanCastSpellWhileMoving honours for its family mask (mask0 0x4000000, mask2 0x2000: every Palm",
    "Sigil); effect 1 is Ascension effect 178 (trigger spell with duration BasePoints + 1 = 8000 ms) for the marker",
    "808089 'Runeshroud or Waveforged', the CasterAuraSpell of every Palm Sigil. Effect 178 has no handler, so the",
    "marker was never granted. Expected: while Runic Tempest lasts the marker is present, so Palm Sigil: Arcane",
    "805380 (1.5 sec cast, 'Usable while moving': InterruptFlags lack the movement bit) is cast while moving;",
    "Runeshroud 500288 ending inside the window keeps the marker; when Runic Tempest ends the marker leaves unless",
    "Runeshroud still grants it. Control: without Runeshroud or Runic Tempest Palm Sigil fails."
  ],
